---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const effective = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' });
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Web Guy Nick LLC"
  description="Privacy policy for webguynick.com, operated by Web Guy Nick LLC."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pt-16 pb-24 prose-custom">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white md:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> {effective}</p>
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy describes how Web Guy Nick LLC (“Web Guy Nick,” “we,” “us,” or “our”)
      collects, uses, and shares information about you when you visit
      <a href="https://webguynick.com">webguynick.com</a> (the “Site”) or use our services.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect information you provide directly, and information collected automatically when you use the Site.</p>
    <h3>Information you provide</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Contact details (name, email, phone, business name) submitted via forms.</li>
      <li>Email address you submit to our newsletter (Mailchimp).</li>
      <li>Any messages, questions, or files you send us.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Device and browser data (user agent, screen size, referrer).</li>
      <li>Approximate location derived from IP address.</li>
      <li>Pages viewed and basic event data via privacy-respecting analytics.</li>
      <li>Cookies and similar technologies (see “Cookies” below).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To respond to inquiries and deliver services you request.</li>
      <li>To send newsletter and marketing emails you have opted in to receive.</li>
      <li>To operate, secure, and improve the Site.</li>
      <li>To comply with legal obligations and enforce our Terms.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share limited data with trusted processors solely to operate the Site and our services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Mailchimp</strong> (email delivery)</li>
      <li><strong>Our hosting and CDN provider</strong> (site delivery, security)</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics provider</strong> (aggregate usage)</li>
      <li><strong>Payment processor</strong>, if you become a client (billing only)</li>
      <li>Law enforcement or government authorities where legally required</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      The Site uses a small number of cookies and similar technologies for essential site function,
      analytics, and — where applicable — affiliate link attribution. You can disable cookies in your browser.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>
      Some outbound links on this Site are affiliate links, including Amazon links using our Amazon
      Associates tag <code>webguynick-20</code> and hosting links via
      <a href="https://link.me/webguynick">link.me/webguynick</a>. When you purchase through these
      links we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. See our full
      <a href="/disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Your Choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Unsubscribe from any email using the link in the footer.</li>
      <li>Email <a href="mailto:info@webguynick.com">info@webguynick.com</a> to request access, correction, or deletion of your personal information.</li>
      <li>You may opt out of certain tracking cookies via your browser settings.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Your Rights (CA/EU/UK)</h2>
    <p>
      If you are a California, EU, or UK resident, you may have rights including access, correction,
      deletion, portability, and objection to certain processing. To exercise these rights, contact
      <a href="mailto:info@webguynick.com">info@webguynick.com</a>. We will verify and respond within the time required by applicable law.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Children</h2>
    <p>The Site is not directed to children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their personal information.</p>

    <h2>9. Security</h2>
    <p>
      We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards. No method of transmission
      or storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
    </p>

    <h2>10. International Users</h2>
    <p>Web Guy Nick LLC operates in the United States. If you access the Site from outside the U.S., you consent to processing in the U.S.</p>

    <h2>11. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this Policy. Material changes will be posted here with a revised Effective Date.</p>

    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Web Guy Nick LLC</strong><br>
      <a href="mailto:info@webguynick.com">info@webguynick.com</a><br>
      (951) 536-0028
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
